---
// Two hardware effects in hot Go loops:
//  1. Spatial locality: one 64B/128B cache line vs unpredictable pointer chasing;
//  2. False sharing: two CPU cores invalidating a shared cache line vs padded lines.
// Plain inline SVG using site CSS tokens; arrowheads are plain polygons (zero IDs).
const W = 900;
const H = 340;
---
<figure class="gp16c">
  <div class="gp16c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: contiguous slice loads eight adjacent integers in one cache line fetch while a linked list stalls on every pointer hop. Bottom: two CPU cores updating adjacent counters invalidate the same cache line until padding separates them onto independent lines.">
    {/* ---------- Row 1: Spatial locality vs pointer chasing ---------- */}
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Spatial locality vs. pointer chasing</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Cục bộ không gian và nhảy con trỏ</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Left: contiguous int64 slice */}
    <text x="20" y="48" class="b">[]int64</text>
    <text x="80" y="48" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>(one 64 B cache line = 8 values)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>(1 cache line 64 B = 8 giá trị)</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="58" width="384" height="36" rx="6" class="good" />
    {[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7].map((n) => (
      <g>
        {n > 0 && <line x1={20 + n * 48} x2={20 + n * 48} y1="58" y2="94" class="div" />}
        <text x={20 + n * 48 + 24} y="81" text-anchor="middle" class="b num">{n}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="20" y="114" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1 miss fetches 0..7 together; prefetcher predicts the next line</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1 lần miss tải cả 0..7; mạch nạp trước tự kéo dòng kế tiếp</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Right: scattered []*node / linked list */}
    <text x="465" y="48" class="b">[]*node</text>
    <text x="530" y="48" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>(unpredictable pointer hops)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>(nhảy con trỏ khó đoán)</tspan>
    </text>
    {[
      { x: 465, label: 'val | next' },
      { x: 615, label: 'val | next' },
      { x: 765, label: 'val | nil' },
    ].map((node, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={node.x} y="58" width="110" height="36" rx="6" class="bad" />
        <text x={node.x + 55} y="81" text-anchor="middle" class="b">{node.label}</text>
        {i < 2 && (
          <g>
            <path d={`M ${node.x + 112} 76 L ${node.x + 140} 76`} class="lnr" />
            <polygon points={`${node.x + 148},76 ${node.x + 139},71 ${node.x + 139},81`} class="hdr" />
          </g>
        )}
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="465" y="114" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Address i+1 waits on DRAM returning pointer i (~80–100 ns stall)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Địa chỉ i+1 phải chờ DRAM trả con trỏ i (~80–100 ns chờ)</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="138" y2="138" class="rule" />

    {/* ---------- Row 2: False sharing vs padded ---------- */}
    <text x="20" y="166" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. False sharing across cores (MESI invalidation)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. False sharing giữa hai nhân (hủy cache line)</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Left: unpadded */}
    <text x="20" y="190" class="b">CountersUnpadded</text>
    <text x="165" y="190" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>(shared cache line)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>(chung cache line)</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="200" width="405" height="38" rx="6" class="bad" />
    <rect x="24" y="204" width="76" height="30" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="62" y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="b">a (8 B)</text>
    <rect x="104" y="204" width="76" height="30" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="142" y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="b">b (8 B)</text>
    <text x="298" y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>invalidates on every write</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>hủy sạch mỗi lần ghi</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Arrows down/up from cores */}
    <line x1="62" x2="62" y1="274" y2="248" class="lnr" />
    <polygon points="62,240 57,249 67,249" class="hdr" />
    <rect x="20" y="276" width="160" height="42" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="100" y="302" text-anchor="middle" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Core 0 writes a</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhân 0 ghi a</tspan>
    </text>

    <path d="M 310 274 L 142 246" class="lnr" />
    <polygon points="135,243 145,241 142,251" class="hdr" />
    <rect x="225" y="276" width="200" height="42" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="325" y="302" text-anchor="middle" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Core 1 writes b</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhân 1 ghi b</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Right: padded */}
    <text x="465" y="190" class="b">CountersPad64 / Pad128</text>
    <text x="655" y="190" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>(separate lines)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>(tách cache line)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="465" y="200" width="195" height="38" rx="6" class="good" />
    <rect x="469" y="204" width="66" height="30" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="502" y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="b">a</text>
    <text x="596" y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>padding</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đệm trống</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="685" y="200" width="195" height="38" rx="6" class="good" />
    <rect x="689" y="204" width="66" height="30" rx="4" class="cell" />
    <text x="722" y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="b">b</text>
    <text x="816" y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>padding</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đệm trống</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="502" x2="502" y1="274" y2="248" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="502,240 497,249 507,249" class="hd" />
    <rect x="465" y="276" width="195" height="42" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="562" y="302" text-anchor="middle" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Core 0 stays cached</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhân 0 giữ cache</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="722" x2="722" y1="274" y2="248" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="722,240 717,249 727,249" class="hd" />
    <rect x="685" y="276" width="195" height="42" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="782" y="302" text-anchor="middle" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Core 1 stays cached</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhân 1 giữ cache</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Top: packing values contiguously in a slice feeds one cache line fetch per eight <code>int64</code> elements, whereas pointer links serialize every read. Bottom: two cores updating independent fields on the same cache line bounce ownership until padding separates them (64 B on x86-64, 128 B on Apple Silicon).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trên: xếp giá trị liền nhau trong slice tận dụng trọn mỗi dòng cache 64 B cho tám số <code>int64</code>, còn chuỗi con trỏ bắt CPU đợi từng lần đọc. Dưới: hai nhân ghi hai biến kề nhau trên cùng một cache line liên tục hủy cache của nhau cho tới khi đệm trống tách chúng sang hai dòng riêng (64 B trên x86-64, 128 B trên Apple Silicon).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp16c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp16c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp16c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp16c text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp16c .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp16c .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp16c .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp16c .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp16c .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp16c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16c .cell { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp16c .good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16c .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16c .div { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1; opacity: 0.6; }
  .gp16c .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp16c .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp16c .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp16c .lnr { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp16c .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .gp16c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
